title: mf gui repo
tags: [[CLI command]] [[Scripting the GUI]]
kind: reference
summary: Print the active repository of the focused workspace

Prints the uuid of the repository of the focused workspace; exit 1 when it has none, or when no slot is focused on a workspace. What a script exports as `METAFOLDER_REPO` to bind every `mf` after it ([[Writing a GUI script]]).
